---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About | aksyuma">
	<section class="max-w-2xl">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4 font-mono">
			/about
		</h1>

		<div class="space-y-6 text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
			<p>
				Platform and distributed systems engineer focused on delivery infrastructure, data movement, and the operational decisions that make systems recoverable.
			</p>

			<p>
				This site is a public engineering knowledge base. It documents bounded case studies, architecture decisions, and reference implementations — each with explicit constraints, evidence levels, and limitations.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-100 font-mono mt-10 mb-3">Method</h2>
			<ul class="space-y-2 list-none">
				<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
					<span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5">→</span>
					<span>Claims are bounded by what can be observed, measured, or safely contextualised</span>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
					<span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5">→</span>
					<span>Sensitive details are omitted, not disguised — anonymisation is a security control</span>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
					<span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5">→</span>
					<span>Decisions record trade-offs and alternatives, not just the selected option</span>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
					<span class="text-emerald-500 mt-0.5">→</span>
					<span>Infrastructure earns its place through documented operational cost</span>
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-100 font-mono mt-10 mb-3">Contact</h2>
			<p>
				<a href="https://github.com/aksyuma" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">github.com/aksyuma</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Base>
